From 9ab47c3fcea5c3af6d5745e5e7fd027047f8bc72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:55:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] build(wasm): camcraft-app links for wasm32 via a pinned
 wasi-sysroot

Rung 1 of the app/UI-on-wasm story. web/build-app-wasm.sh builds
camcraft-app (flecs' C included) for wasm32-unknown-unknown and links
camcraft-cli.wasm: the pinned wasi-sysroot 34 supplies libc headers and
libc.a for flecs.c, and three checked edits to copies of flecs_ecs 0.2.2 /
flecs_ecs_sys 0.2.1 (libc::FILE, "C-unwind" bindings, a wasm-gated
import) are wired in with cargo --config patch for that build only.
Native builds and the tracked Cargo.lock are untouched. The manual
(workflow_dispatch) wasm CI job runs the script.

The UI rung is not here: egui-winit 0.36.2 does not compile for wasm32,
so the browser shell needs eframe's web runner; the remaining blockers
are listed in docs/decisions/31-wasm-ui.md.

Refs #31

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
